[{"id":180269791,"discussion_id":"8be0d54bdcfdd262e3a5a1aa079c5761ca42eaa1","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本次 PR 修复了 `GroupedMatmulSwigluQuantWeightNzV2` 中因 PR #7302 引入的 MXA8W4 多 Tensor 转置处理回归问题。PR #7302 使用 `IsMultiTensorWeight()` 判断跳过多 Tensor 的转置 view 重建，但该方法无法区分 MXA8W4 多 Tensor 与 MXFP4/MXFP8 FRACTAL_NZ 多 Tensor，导致 MXA8W4 多 Tensor 场景也错误地跳过了必要的 view 重建。本次修改将条件替换为 `IsMxWeightNzMultiTensorSupported()`，该方法仅匹配 MX 量化模式、非 MXA8W4、FRACTAL_NZ/私有存储格式且二维 view shape 的专用场景，从而使 MXA8W4 多 Tensor 能够继续执行原有的转置 view 重建逻辑。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **条件判断替换**：在 `grouped_matmul_swiglu_quant_v2_utils.h` 的转置 view 重建路径中，将 `if (!IsMultiTensorWeight())` 替换为 `if (!IsMxWeightNzMultiTensorSupported())`，确保仅 MX WeightNz 多 Tensor（FRACTAL_NZ 格式）跳过 view 重建，而 MXA8W4 多 Tensor 仍能进入重建分支。\n- **注释说明**：新增注释解释 MX WeightNz 多 Tensor 输入在后续专用 contiguous 路径中归一化，其他转置输入（包括 MXA8W4 多 Tensor）仍需在此处完成 view 转换。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-16T11:05:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T11:07:41+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180269828,"discussion_id":"653da7753840dd9375b0ef1ec747d36e55047974","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n zhangzhizhuo, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-16T11:05:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-16T11:05:19+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180269836,"discussion_id":"fcdd1cb7ad3c310880221f6ce3017b3b055b8f8f","body":"Thanks for your pull-reque